SUMMARY:ACNS 2027 Annual Meeting and Courses
DESCRIPTION:The American Clinical Neurophysiology Society holds its 2027 
 Annual Meeting and Courses at the Hyatt Regency Seattle in Seattle\, Was
 hington\, from 4 to 7 March 2027. The program covers clinical neurophysi
 ology topics including EEG\, EMG\, and neurocritical care monitoring.\n\
 nDeadlines\nScientific program and course submission opens: 2026-04-15\n
 Scientific program and course submission: 2026-05-31\nPoster abstract su
 bmission opens: 2026-10-01\nPoster abstract submission: 2026-11-15\nHous
 ing block deadline: 2027-02-08\n\nhttps://www.acns.org/meetings/meetings
 --programs-calendar/2027
LOCATION:Seattle\, Washington\, Hyatt Regency Seattle
URL:https://www.acns.org/meetings/meetings--programs-calendar/2027
